  "title": "Mini Sausage Pancake Skewers with Spicy Syrup",
  "description": "Drizzled with a spicy maple syrup, these tiny savory skewers with mini pancakes and sausage are perfect for breakfast or a great addition to a brunch buffet.",
  "authors": [
    "lutzflcat"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-02-05T21:27:04-05:00",
